# ex32 — density fields fixture (mirrors demos/6-space/060-density-fields.bqn)
# The demo's 8-cell strip as an 8 1 lattice: density and fertility are per-cell count
# fields (fertility -1 at cell 2 must be excluded by the > 0 predicate, never treated as
# a zero count). Entity world starts empty; shared by 060-density-fields-a/-b.ano.
n 0
col tree bool
col crop bool
col pos num
lattice 8 1
field density num 0 2 1 0 3 0 1 2
field fertility num 2 0 -1 3 0 1 4 0
ja 木 tree
ja 作物 crop
ja 位置 pos
ja 密度 density
ja 肥沃 fertility
